<title>USA: Proffitt's January same store sales up.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's January same store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>			1997     1996    Total  Same-Store</p>
<p>  Month	    $98.0     $67.7   +45	+12</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended February 1, 1997 compared with four weeks ended January 27, 1996.</p>
<p>Total sales include $28.7 million of sales from Parisian division. Company merged with Parisian Inc on October 11, 1996.  Comparable store-sales numbers do not include Parisian sales.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
